#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to request an IBM Quantum Classroom Account and set it up for your users"
msgstr "Cara meminta Akun Kelas IBM Quantum dan menyiapkannya untuk pengguna kamu"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a Classroom Account"
msgstr "Buat Akun Kelas"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a Classroom Account {#create-a-classroom-account}"
msgstr "Buat Akun Kelas {#create-a-classroom-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An IBM Quantum&reg; Classroom Account is a simple way for educators to set up and manage access for their students to use IBM Quantum hardware under the Open Plan, without the need to enter credit card information. The Open Plan provides 10 minutes of quantum processing unit (QPU) usage per 28-day rolling window.\n"
msgstr "Akun Kelas IBM Quantum&reg; adalah cara sederhana bagi pengajar untuk menyiapkan dan mengelola akses bagi siswa mereka agar bisa menggunakan hardware IBM Quantum di bawah Open Plan, tanpa perlu memasukkan informasi kartu kredit. Open Plan menyediakan 10 menit penggunaan quantum processing unit (QPU) per jendela bergulir 28 hari.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Submit a request {#submit-a-request}"
msgstr "Kirim permintaan {#submit-a-request}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fill out [this form](https://ibm.biz/classroom-account) to submit a request for a Classroom Account.\n"
msgstr "Isi [formulir ini](https://ibm.biz/classroom-account) untuk mengirimkan permintaan Akun Kelas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Approved Classroom Account applicants will receive an email that contains a 32-digit feature code, which you will need during the activation process below.\n"
msgstr "Pemohon Akun Kelas yang disetujui akan menerima email yang berisi kode fitur 32 digit, yang akan kamu perlukan selama proses aktivasi di bawah ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Don't forget to submit your account ID\">\n"
"If you are approved for a Classroom Account, do not delete the confirmation email you receive. In addition to the feature code, it also contains instructions for submitting your new account ID back to the IBM Quantum team so that the account can be activated. **Classroom Accounts will not be activated without this final step.**\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Jangan lupa mengirimkan ID akun kamu\">\n"
"Jika kamu disetujui untuk Akun Kelas, jangan hapus email konfirmasi yang kamu terima. Selain kode fitur, email tersebut juga berisi instruksi untuk mengirimkan ID akun baru kamu kembali ke tim IBM Quantum agar akun dapat diaktifkan. **Akun Kelas tidak akan diaktifkan tanpa langkah terakhir ini.**\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate the account {#activate-the-account}"
msgstr "Aktifkan akun {#activate-the-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Approved Classroom Account applicants will receive an email that contains a 32-digit feature code. Do not delete this email; it contains important information for submitting your new account ID once you've set up your account, which is a required step to complete the activation. \n"
msgstr "Pemohon Akun Kelas yang disetujui akan menerima email yang berisi kode fitur 32 digit. Jangan hapus email ini; email ini berisi informasi penting untuk mengirimkan ID akun baru kamu setelah kamu menyiapkan akun kamu, yang merupakan langkah wajib untuk menyelesaikan aktivasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once you have a feature code, follow the activation steps below:\n"
msgstr "Setelah kamu memiliki kode fitur, ikuti langkah-langkah aktivasi di bawah ini:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Do not enter credit card details\">\n"
"When creating an account with a feature code, do not provide credit card information on IBM Cloud&reg; unless you are actively upgrading to a paid account and are willing to accept being billed for consumed services.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Jangan masukkan detail kartu kredit\">\n"
"Saat membuat akun dengan kode fitur, jangan berikan informasi kartu kredit pada IBM Cloud&reg; kecuali kamu secara aktif melakukan upgrade ke akun berbayar dan bersedia menerima tagihan untuk layanan yang digunakan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visit https://cloud.ibm.com/.\n"
msgstr "Kunjungi https://cloud.ibm.com/.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click **Create account**. You must create a new account even if you have a personal IBM Cloud account, because the Classroom Account is not attached to your personal account.\n"
msgstr "Klik **Create account**. Kamu harus membuat akun baru meskipun kamu sudah memiliki akun IBM Cloud pribadi, karena Akun Kelas tidak terhubung dengan akun pribadi kamu.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter a valid email address and a password. Use an email address that is **not** associated with an existing IBM Cloud account. Click **Next**.\n"
msgstr "Masukkan alamat email yang valid dan kata sandi. Gunakan alamat email yang **tidak** terkait dengan akun IBM Cloud yang sudah ada. Klik **Next**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check your email inbox for a seven-digit verification code, then return to the account creation form. Enter that code to verify your new account.\n"
msgstr "Periksa kotak masuk email kamu untuk kode verifikasi tujuh digit, lalu kembali ke formulir pembuatan akun. Masukkan kode tersebut untuk memverifikasi akun baru kamu.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Important:** In the Personal information section, do not enter your first and last name. Instead, in the \"First name\" field, enter your institutional affiliation, and in the \"Last name\" field, enter the name of the course using the account. Enter your country or region.\n"
msgstr "**Penting:** Pada bagian Personal information, jangan masukkan nama depan dan nama belakang kamu. Sebagai gantinya, pada kolom \"First name\", masukkan afiliasi institusional kamu, dan pada kolom \"Last name\", masukkan nama mata kuliah yang menggunakan akun ini. Masukkan negara atau wilayah kamu.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Complete the Account notice and click **Continue**.\n"
msgstr "Selesaikan Account notice dan klik **Continue**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Complete the Account privacy notice and click **Continue**.\n"
msgstr "Selesaikan Account privacy notice dan klik **Continue**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "At the Verify identity screen, click **Register with a code**. \n"
msgstr "Pada layar Verify identity, klik **Register with a code**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter your 32-digit feature code from your confirmation email in the **Enter code** text box, then click **Create account**.\n"
msgstr "Masukkan kode fitur 32 digit kamu dari email konfirmasi kamu pada kotak teks **Enter code**, lalu klik **Create account**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to your [account settings on IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/account) and copy the Account ID (found under Details). \n"
msgstr "Buka [pengaturan akun kamu di IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/account) dan salin Account ID (ditemukan di bawah Details).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow the instructions in the confirmation email you received to send this ID number to the IBM Quantum team, and they will process the Classroom Account for full activation.\n"
msgstr "Ikuti instruksi dalam email konfirmasi yang kamu terima untuk mengirimkan nomor ID ini ke tim IBM Quantum, dan mereka akan memproses Akun Kelas untuk aktivasi penuh.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add users {#add-users}"
msgstr "Tambahkan pengguna {#add-users}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, ensure you have the correct account and region selected in the account and region switchers in the[IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) header.\n"
msgstr "Pertama, pastikan kamu telah memilih akun dan region yang benar pada pengalih akun dan region di header [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select [**Access management**](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) from the main menu.\n"
msgstr "Pilih [**Access management**](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) dari menu utama.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "On the Users tab, click \"Invite user\".\n"
msgstr "Pada tab Users, klik \"Invite user\".\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter the users' email addresses. You can add multiple addresses at the same time.\n"
msgstr "Masukkan alamat email pengguna. Kamu bisa menambahkan beberapa alamat sekaligus.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default, an instance is assigned to each new user. It is recommended to accept the default setting.\n"
msgstr "Secara default, sebuah instance ditetapkan untuk setiap pengguna baru. Disarankan untuk menerima pengaturan default.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    The instance name will automatically be based on the user's email address (without the `@` character and the domain name). In the \"Instance naming schema\" field, you can customize a prefix for each instance name; for example, if a student's email address is `john-doe@university.edu`, and you specify `physics-101` as the prefix for this account, the instance name will be `physics-101-john-doe`. If you don't specify a prefix, the default prefix `open-student` will be used (`open-student-john-doe`).\n"
"1. The user will receive an invitation to create an IBM Cloud account and join the instance. They will not need to enter credit card information to create their account. \n"
"1. After the user accepts the invitation and creates their account, they can navigate to [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), where they will see their Classroom Account instance in the account switcher in the page header.\n"
msgstr ""
"    Nama instance akan secara otomatis didasarkan pada alamat email pengguna (tanpa karakter `@` dan nama domain). Pada kolom \"Instance naming schema\", kamu bisa menyesuaikan prefix untuk setiap nama instance; misalnya, jika alamat email seorang siswa adalah `john-doe@university.edu`, dan kamu menentukan `physics-101` sebagai prefix untuk akun ini, nama instance-nya akan menjadi `physics-101-john-doe`. Jika kamu tidak menentukan prefix, prefix default `open-student` akan digunakan (`open-student-john-doe`).\n"
"1. Pengguna akan menerima undangan untuk membuat akun IBM Cloud dan bergabung dengan instance. Mereka tidak perlu memasukkan informasi kartu kredit untuk membuat akun mereka.\n"
"1. Setelah pengguna menerima undangan dan membuat akun mereka, mereka bisa membuka [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), di mana mereka akan melihat instance Akun Kelas mereka di pengalih akun pada header halaman.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove users {#remove-users}"
msgstr "Hapus pengguna {#remove-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To remove a user from a Classroom Account, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr "Untuk menghapus pengguna dari Akun Kelas, ikuti langkah-langkah berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "On the Users tab, click the three-dot menu at the end of that user's row. \n"
msgstr "Pada tab Users, klik menu tiga titik di ujung baris pengguna tersebut.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select Remove user. You will see a prompt to confirm that you want to remove the user from the account. Click Remove to confirm.\n"
msgstr "Pilih Remove user. Kamu akan melihat prompt untuk mengonfirmasi bahwa kamu ingin menghapus pengguna tersebut dari akun. Klik Remove untuk mengonfirmasi.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage instances {#manage-instances}"
msgstr "Kelola instance {#manage-instances}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each instance provides up to 10 minutes of QPU usage per 28-day rolling window.\n"
msgstr "Setiap instance menyediakan hingga 10 menit penggunaan QPU per jendela bergulir 28 hari.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As the Classroom Account owner, you can view all activity across all instances in the account on the [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) page.\n"
msgstr "Sebagai pemilik Akun Kelas, kamu bisa melihat semua aktivitas di seluruh instance dalam akun tersebut pada halaman [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Student users can see data from workloads run in their own instance. They cannot see data from any other instances.\n"
msgstr "Pengguna siswa bisa melihat data dari workload yang dijalankan di instance mereka sendiri. Mereka tidak bisa melihat data dari instance lainnya.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Renew the Classroom Account {#renew-the-classroom-account}"
msgstr "Perbarui Akun Kelas {#renew-the-classroom-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To renew a Classroom Account that is nearing its expiration date, request a new feature code using this [renewal form](https://ibm.biz/account-renewal). \n"
msgstr "Untuk memperbarui Akun Kelas yang mendekati tanggal kedaluwarsanya, minta kode fitur baru menggunakan [formulir pembaruan ini](https://ibm.biz/account-renewal).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah selanjutnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"Direct your students to the [documentation](/guides/compute-services) for details on how to use IBM Quantum Platform. Commonly used topics include the following:\n"
"- [View backend details](/guides/qpu-information)\n"
"- [Minimize job run time](/guides/minimize-time)\n"
"- [Organize and search by job tags](/guides/add-job-tags)\n"
"- [Retrieve and save job results](/guides/save-jobs)\n"
"- [Monitor or cancel a job](/guides/monitor-job)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"Arahkan siswa kamu ke [dokumentasi](/guides/compute-services) untuk detail cara menggunakan IBM Quantum Platform. Topik yang umum digunakan meliputi berikut ini:\n"
"- [Lihat detail backend](/guides/qpu-information)\n"
"- [Minimalkan waktu jalan job](/guides/minimize-time)\n"
"- [Atur dan cari berdasarkan tag job](/guides/add-job-tags)\n"
"- [Ambil dan simpan hasil job](/guides/save-jobs)\n"
"- [Pantau atau batalkan job](/guides/monitor-job)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
